// the values lenders reported for mortgaged home purchases (HMDA), blended across the census tracts around each station as the
// Finnish maps blend postal codes: per home only (perHome), from 2018 (baseYear), counts are weighted purchases. Drafts.
const HMDA_JA={'subordinate liens (a second loan on the same purchase)':'第2順位以下の抵当（同じ購入の2本目のローン）','no property value reported':'物件価格の報告がないもの','manufactured homes':'工場生産住宅','buildings of five or more units':'5戸以上の建物','no census tract reported':'国勢調査区の報告がないもの','property values under $10,000 or over $20 million':'物件価格が1万ドル未満または2,000万ドル超',"a tract not in the year's layer":'その年の調査区にない調査区'},
  hmdaCoverage=(where,whereJa)=>{const c=D.coverage,K=c.counts,alt=c.with_other_occupancy||{},pc=x=>x==null?'—':`${x>0?'+':x<0?'−':'±'}${Math.abs(Math.round(x*1000)/10)}%`,
    list=Object.entries(c.exclusions).map(([r,ys])=>[r,Object.values(ys).reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)]).sort((a,b)=>b[1]-a[1]).map(([r,v])=>JA?`${esc(HMDA_JA[r]||r)} ${fmt(v)}件`:`${fmt(v)} ${esc(r)}`).join(J('; ','、')),
    table=`<div class="tablewrap"><table>${heads(JA?['年','住宅購入ローン','本人居住用','駅の近く','駅に数えた件数（加重）']:['Year','Purchase loans','Principal residence','Near a station','Counted (weighted)'])}<tbody>${Object.entries(c.by_year).map(([y,v])=>`<tr><td>${y}</td><td>${fmt(v.raw||0)}</td><td>${fmt(v.principal||0)}</td><td>${fmt(v.near||0)}</td><td>${fmt(Math.round(v.counted||0))}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`;
    return JA?`<p>2026年10月31日作成。HMDA（住宅抵当貸付開示法）の公開ローンデータ2018〜2025年（${whereJa}）による。実行された住宅購入ローン${fmt(K.raw)}件のうち${fmt(K.eligible)}件が条件を満たし、そのうち本人居住用の${fmt(K.principal)}件を使う。セカンドハウス${fmt(K['second homes'])}件と投資用の購入${fmt(K['investment purchases'])}件は既定では使わない（加えると、最新の期間の駅の価格は中央値で${pc(alt.median_price_change)}、購入件数は${pc(alt.median_loans_added)}変わる）。調査区の陸地が駅の1.2 km圏に入る割合で各ローンを重み付けすると、${fmt(c.sites_shown)}駅のいずれかに数えるのは${fmt(K.in_windows)}件分である。「駅の近く」は、いずれかの駅の円にかかる調査区のローンの件数である。</p>${table}<p>使っていないもの：${list}。</p>`
      :`<p>Built 31 October 2026 from the HMDA public loan-level data for 2018–2025 (${where}). Of ${fmt(K.raw)} originated home-purchase loans, ${fmt(K.eligible)} pass the filters, and the ${fmt(K.principal)} for a principal residence are used; ${fmt(K['second homes'])} second homes and ${fmt(K['investment purchases'])} investment purchases are left out by default (adding them would change the latest window's station prices by a median ${pc(alt.median_price_change)}, and their purchases by ${pc(alt.median_loans_added)}). Weighted by the share of their census tract's land inside a station's 1.2 km circle, ${fmt(K.in_windows)} of them count at one of ${fmt(c.sites_shown)} stations. Near a station counts the loans in tracts that a station's circle touches.</p>${table}<p>Not used: ${list}.</p>`};
